{
  "id": "102-94-uplifting-the-heart-ash-shar",
  "title": "94. Uplifting the Heart (Ash-Sharḥ)",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "94. Uplifting the Heart",
      "page": 604
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "(Ash-Sharḥ)",
      "page": 605
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "*Like the previous sûrah, this sûrah reminds the Prophet (* صلى الله عليه وسلم *) of more* *blessings to reassure him of Allah’s continued support in the city of Mecca,* which is mentioned in the next sûrah.",
      "page": 605
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "In the Name of Allah—the Most Compassionate, Most Merciful",
      "page": 605
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "More Reassurance to the Prophet",
      "page": 605
    },
    {
      "t": "li",
      "n": 1,
      "text": "Have We not uplifted your heart for you ˹O Prophet˺,",
      "page": 605
    },
    {
      "t": "li",
      "n": 2,
      "text": "relieved you of the burden",
      "page": 605
    },
    {
      "t": "li",
      "n": 3,
      "text": "which weighed so heavily on your back,",
      "page": 605
    },
    {
      "t": "li",
      "n": 4,
      "text": "and elevated your renown for you?[1315]",
      "page": 605
    },
    {
      "t": "li",
      "n": 5,
      "text": "So, surely with hardship comes ease.",
      "page": 605
    },
    {
      "t": "li",
      "n": 6,
      "text": "Surely with ˹that˺ hardship comes ˹more˺ ease. [1316]",
      "page": 605
    },
    {
      "t": "li",
      "n": 7,
      "text": "So once you have fulfilled ˹your duty˺, strive ˹in devotion˺,",
      "page": 605
    },
    {
      "t": "li",
      "n": 8,
      "text": "turning to your Lord",
      "page": 605
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "˹alone˺ with hope.",
      "page": 605
    }
  ]
}